  COUNTEREXAMPLE: (1, 2, 2, 2, 4, 4) is ambiguous but NOT self-complementary
    Its complement is (1, 1, 3, 3, 3, 4)
    Complement H values: [19, 23, 27]
    Complement is ambiguous: True
  COUNTEREXAMPLE: (1, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3) is ambiguous but NOT self-complementary
