========================================================================


  At n=5: 100% of the residual comes from (1,2,2,2,3).
  At n=6: Which class contributes the MOST to the residual?

  DOMINANT PoS at n=6: (1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 4)
    S₂ = 5.5
    Score automorphism |Aut| = 4
    Tournaments in class: 8640
    H values: [23, 25, 29, 31, 33, 37]
